    "%@. Each is checked again right before it goes. You can undo right after, or put them back from the Trash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。每一项在移走前都会再检查一次。你可以随后立即撤销，也可以稍后从废纸篓放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. Everything goes to the Trash, so you can undo right after or put things back from the Trash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。所有内容都会移到废纸篓，你可以随后立即撤销，也可以稍后从废纸篓放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. One copy of each file stays where it is. You can undo right after, or put them back from the Trash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。每个文件会保留一份在原处。你可以随后立即撤销，也可以稍后从废纸篓放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. One picture of each group stays where it is. Look at them first: pictures that look alike aren't always copies. You can undo right after." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。每组会保留一张在原处。请先查看：看起来相似的照片并不都是副本。你可以随后立即撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. They stop starting from the next login; one that's running now keeps running until then, or until you quit its app. You can undo right after, or put them back from the Trash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。它们将从下次登录起不再启动；当前正在运行的会继续运行到下次登录，或直到你退出所属应用。你可以随后立即撤销，也可以稍后从废纸篓放回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@. You can undo right after, or put them back from the Trash later." : {
      "localizations" : {
