    "A folder left out isn't read or counted, and isn't compared in Changes, so it never looks deleted. It's apart from Keep, which only stops moves, and from Browse's filter, which only hides rows." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "排除的文件夹不会被读取或统计，也不会在“变更”中参与比较，因此永远不会显得被删除。它不同于“保留”（只阻止移动），也不同于“浏览”的筛选（只隐藏列表行）。"
