    },
    "Check extra copies in this list. The newest copy in each group stays unchecked, and protected copies stay. Unchecking clears this list only; nothing is moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此列表中勾选多余的副本。每组中最新的副本保持未勾选，受保护的副本也会保留。取消勾选只会清空此列表，不会移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check extra pictures in this list. The best picture in each group stays unchecked, and protected pictures stay. Unchecking clears this list only; nothing is moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此列表中勾选多余的照片。每组中最好的照片保持未勾选，受保护的照片也会保留。取消勾选只会清空此列表，不会移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check or uncheck eligible items in this list, including rows below the screen. Filters limit this choice. Highlighting rows is separate; nothing is removed here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "勾选或取消勾选此列表中符合条件的项目，包括屏幕下方的行。筛选条件会限制可选范围。高亮行是另一项功能；此处不会移除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the removable items listed for this project within the age filter. Protected data stays. Expanded contents go with their chosen parent; nothing is moved here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
