    "Choose its copy in your Trash to verify its own files, helpers and app groups. This can find more when you still use other apps from the same developer. If the Trash was emptied, only the conservative search above is available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
