        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a handle to move a card. Drag its corner sideways to resize. Cards fill each row and share its height." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动控制柄可移动卡片。横拖卡片角可调整大小。卡片铺满每行并共用行高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag column dividers to resize. Double-click a divider to fit visible contents. Right-click a heading to show or hide columns. Scroll sideways or hover to read full text." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动列分隔线可调整宽度。双击分隔线可贴合可见内容。右键点击标题可显示或隐藏列。横向滚动或悬停可查看完整文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag sideways to resize, or click to toggle width. Cards in a row share a height." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "横向拖动可调整大小，点按可切换宽度。同一行的卡片共用高度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag this app into the App Management list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将此应用拖入“应用管理”列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to reorder %@. The Actions menu also offers Move Earlier and Move Later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动可调整 %1$@ 的顺序。“操作”菜单也提供“前移”和“后移”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop an app here to uninstall it." : {
      "localizations" : {
