    "Duplicate search queue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重复项搜索队列"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duplicates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重复项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each app goes to the Trash with the leftovers you choose. Only caches and logs tied by identity start chosen; settings, website data, scripts, launch configuration and name matches stay unless you choose them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个应用会连同你选择的残留项一起移到废纸篓。只有按身份关联的缓存和日志默认勾选；设置、网站数据、脚本、启动配置和名称匹配项，在你选择之前都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each control has six steps, from Gentle to Hyperspeed, and starts at Maximum. Hyperspeed removes every limit and can use a lot of memory and disk. Results are complete at every step. If MyMole makes this Mac sluggish, lower a control. Scans can always be stopped, and a change applies from the next scan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个控件有六档，从“轻柔”到“极速”，默认停在“最大”。极速会取消所有限制，可能占用大量内存和磁盘。每一档的结果都是完整的。如果 MyMole 让这台 Mac 变卡，就调低档位。扫描随时可以停止，改动从下次扫描起生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each folder row includes its contents. Your data stays unless you choose it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个文件夹行都包含其内容。除非你选择，否则你的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each leftover shows how it's tied to the app. Only caches and logs tied by identity start chosen. Settings, website data, saved state, scripts, launch configuration and name matches stay unless you choose them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每项残留都会显示它与应用的关联方式。只有按身份关联的缓存和日志默认勾选。设置、网站数据、保存的状态、脚本、启动配置和名称匹配项，在你选择之前都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each pane's last scan and the disk map's history, shown at once after a launch: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各面板上次的扫描和磁盘图历史，在启动后一次性加载：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each scan keeps folders %lld levels deep from %@ and files from %@; changes below %@ aren't listed, and smaller files aren't compared one by one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Each scan keeps folders %1$lld levels deep from %2$@ and files from %3$@; changes below %4$@ aren't listed, and smaller files aren't compared one by one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次扫描保留从 %2$@ 起 %1$lld 层深的文件夹，以及从 %3$@ 起的文件；%4$@ 之下的变更不会列出，更小的文件也不会逐个比对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier scan" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较早的扫描"
          }
        }
