    },
    "Health" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康状况"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康状况 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helper" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helper disabled — macOS asks for administrator approval per task." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序已停用 —— macOS 会在每次任务时请求管理员批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helper enabled for administrator tasks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序已为管理员任务启用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helper enabled — approved tasks don't need a password each time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序已启用 —— 已批准的任务无需每次输入密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here's how your Mac is doing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Mac 当前状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden settings and deeper name matches are searched automatically. The direct edition also checks exact app IDs in per-user temporary/cache folders. These results start unchosen; temporary data may contain unsaved work." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏的设置和更深层的名称匹配会被自动搜索。直装版还会检查每个用户的临时/缓存文件夹中精确的应用 ID。这些结果默认不勾选；临时数据可能包含未保存的工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Card" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏卡片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide Chart" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏图表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide or show the sidebar (⌃⌘S)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示或隐藏边栏（⌃⌘S）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the chart and give the list the whole pane" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏图表，让列表占满面板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "High pressure" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高压力"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds the least. The disk map is let go a while after you leave it and isn't prepared at launch; running scans repaint less often." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占用最少。离开一段时间后会释放磁盘图，启动时也不预加载；进行中的扫描刷新频率更低。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew formulae and casks, and packages installers put on the Mac, read from where they're kept. Nothing is run and nothing is removed here: a package goes with its own tool, so its records stay right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从存放位置读取 Homebrew formula 与 cask，以及安装器放到 Mac 上的软件包。这里既不运行也不移除任何东西：软件包由它自带的工具处理，这样其记录才不会出错。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew isn't installed in /opt/homebrew or /usr/local." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 未安装在 /opt/homebrew 或 /usr/local 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Homebrew wasn't found, or this edition may not look where it installs: the App Sandbox keeps App Store apps out of /opt/homebrew and /usr/local." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找不到 Homebrew，或此版本无法查看它的安装位置：应用沙箱不允许应用商店版访问 /opt/homebrew 和 /usr/local。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How lists, selection and status look with these choices." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些选项下列表、选择与状态的显示效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long lists, table menus, app listings and Disk Map scans take, including the first content. Kept in memory until you quit; no file names or paths." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列表、表格菜单、应用列表和磁盘图扫描的耗时，包括首屏内容。数据只保存在内存中，退出后即丢失；不含文件名或路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to draw the disk map" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘图的绘制方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hyperspeed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "极速"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hyperspeed: no limits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "极速：无限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icicle, levels left to right" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "冰柱图，层级自左向右"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icons" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identical Files" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相同文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identical duplicates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全相同的重复项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If an ordinary app move is denied, MyMole asks permission to control Finder. Finder can then ask for administrator approval for the app you already chose. You do not need to select the app again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果普通方式移动应用被拒绝，MyMole 会请求控制访达的权限。随后访达可以为你已经选择的应用请求管理员批准。你无需重新选择该应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If file permissions still block the move, use Show App in Finder in the review. Finder can request an administrator's approval." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果文件权限仍然阻止移动，请在检查界面使用“在访达中显示应用”。访达可以请求管理员批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it goes: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果移除：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If macOS asks you to quit and reopen MyMole, follow that prompt. This page continues automatically when access is detected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果 macOS 要求你退出并重新打开 MyMole，请照此操作。检测到权限后，此页面会自动继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Documents" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“文档”中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Downloads" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“下载”中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, turn on this copy of MyMole. If it isn't listed, use + to add it. Show This Copy in Finder locates the app you're using now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“隐私与安全性”→“完全磁盘访问”中打开这份 MyMole 副本。若未列出，请用 + 添加。“在访达中显示此副本”可定位你当前正在使用的应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In every project" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个项目中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In progress" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "进行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In the Background" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在后台"
          }
        }
      }
