        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "集成…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interface" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "界面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invert Selection" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反向选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has used a whole core for %lld minutes or more, and may be stuck. Look at it in Live Status, or quit it if you don't need it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它已占满一个核心 %1$lld 分钟以上，可能卡住了。请在“实时状态”中查看，如果不需要就退出它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It isn't a scan saved from MyMole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是 MyMole 保存的扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It left %@ of settings, caches and data in your Library. Click to look at them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它在你的“资源库”中留下了 %1$@ 的设置、缓存和数据。点按可查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It starts in the menu bar, without a window, and scans when the Mac has time to spare." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它从菜单栏启动，不打开窗口，并在 Mac 空闲时扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stopped part-way, and what it had moved aside is still in %@, with a note of where each item came from. MyMole never deletes it by itself, and a new removal only deletes what it moves itself. Look at it in Finder; it needs an administrator to open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它中途停止，之前移到一旁的内容仍在 %1$@ 中，并附有每项的来源记录。MyMole 从不自行删除它，新的移除也只会删除自己移动的内容。请在访达中查看；打开它需要管理员权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was saved by a newer MyMole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它由更新版本的 MyMole 保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's already running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它已在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's damaged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它已损坏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's larger than a saved scan can be." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它超出了单次保存扫描的大小上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Item kind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its name or app ID has a development, preview or test label. This isn't proof it's disposable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的名称或应用 ID 带有开发、预览或测试标记。这并不能证明它可以丢弃。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its window opens at login. With the menu bar item on, it starts there instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "登录时会打开其窗口。开启菜单栏项目后，改为在菜单栏启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jobs an app registers from inside itself aren't files, so they aren't listed here. Turn those off in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions. What each file says (starts at login, turned off) is what should happen; \"running now\" and \"not loaded now\" are what launchd has for your session." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用从内部注册的任务不是文件，因此不会列在这里。请在“系统设置”→“通用”→“登录项与扩展”中关闭它们。每个文件显示的状态（登录时启动、已关闭）表示应当发生的情况；“正在运行”和“当前未载入”是 launchd 在你当前会话中的实际状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep %@ and move only the chosen leftovers to the Trash, so it starts over as on its first launch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留 %1$@，只把选中的残留项移到废纸篓，使它像首次启动时一样重新开始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep MyMole in the menu bar? The disk, memory and what the scans found at a glance. You can change this in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 MyMole 留在菜单栏？一眼即可看到磁盘、内存和扫描发现。你可以在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep timings of the interface" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留界面耗时记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep timings of the interface Copy Timings Clear benchmark slow speed median p95 filter sort redraw menus first content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留界面耗时记录 拷贝耗时 清除 基准 慢 速度 中位数 p95 筛选 排序 重绘 菜单 首屏内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps a few charts and icons ready, and repaints running scans about three times a second." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持少量图表和图标就绪，进行中的扫描约每秒重绘三次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps more charts, icons and text measurements ready, and repaints running scans more often." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持更多图表、图标和文字测量就绪，进行中的扫描重绘更频繁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the disk map and recent charts ready, and repaints running scans five times a second." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持磁盘图和近期图表就绪，进行中的扫描每秒重绘五次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the most within limits ready, repaints running scans most often, and reuses a result only minutes old at launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在限制内保持最多的内容就绪，进行中的扫描重绘最频繁，启动时只复用几分钟内的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保留"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept as the best: the most pixels, then the biggest file, then the newest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作为最佳保留：像素最多，其次文件最大，再次最新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept in Projects or on your keep list, or holds something that is; never moved from here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留在“项目”中或位于你的保留清单上，或其中包含这类项目；不会从这里移走"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept in Projects, or holds something that is; never cleaned from here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留在“项目”中，或其中包含这类项目；不会从这里清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept items, and anything inside them, are never offered or moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已保留的项目及其中的任何内容，都不会被选中或移动。"
