          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole can uninstall itself, including the data you choose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 可以卸载自身，包括你选择的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't change the helper registration. Keep the signed app in Applications and try again in Settings → System Tasks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 无法更改辅助程序注册。请将已签名的应用放在“应用程序”中，然后在“设置”→“系统任务”中重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't keep access to that folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 无法保留对该文件夹的访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't read %@%@, so this may not be everything. " : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "MyMole couldn't read %1$@%2$@, so this may not be everything. "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't read inside this folder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 无法读取此文件夹内的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't read the Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 无法读取废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole couldn't tell whether it has Full Disk Access: none of the folders it checks are on this Mac. It goes on as if it has; a folder it can't read is said where it shows up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 无法判断自己是否拥有“完全磁盘访问”：它检查的文件夹都不在这台 Mac 上。它会按已拥有该权限继续运行；遇到无法读取的文件夹时，会在其显示处说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole doesn't have Full Disk Access, so the folders macOS protects stay closed to it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 没有“完全磁盘访问”，因此 macOS 保护的文件夹对它保持关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole found things to clean" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 找到了可清理的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole has Full Disk Access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 已拥有“完全磁盘访问”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole is a native Mac cleaner. Everything it removes is chosen by you; your own files go to the Trash, with Undo. In the direct edition, system tasks use administrator approval or the optional approved helper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 是一款原生 Mac 清理工具。它移除的一切都由你选择；你自己的文件会移到废纸篓，并且可以撤销。直装版中，系统任务使用管理员授权或可选的已批准辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole is closing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 正在关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole is in the Trash. Some chosen data couldn't be moved and stays where it is. Quit when you're ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 已在废纸篓中。部分所选数据无法移动，仍留在原处。准备好后请退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole is preparing to uninstall and quit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 正在准备卸载并退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole is source-available. Personal non-commercial use is permitted; business and organizational use requires a paid commercial license." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 公开源代码。允许个人非商业使用；商业与组织使用需要付费商业许可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole keeps every scan of a folder. Scan again later — after an update, a project, a week of use — and compare any two to see exactly what grew." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 会保留同一文件夹的每次扫描。稍后再扫一次 —— 系统升级后、新建项目后、用了一周后 —— 然后比较任意两次，就能看清究竟什么变大了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole looks for folders with a project file (Package.swift, package.json, .git …) in %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 在 %1$@ 中查找含项目文件（Package.swift、package.json、.git …）的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole looks for folders with a project file (Package.swift, package.json, .git …) in no folders yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 目前还没有在任何文件夹中查找含项目文件（Package.swift、package.json、.git …）的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs Full Disk Access before it can scan. What's shown is from earlier scans." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要“完全磁盘访问”才能扫描。当前显示的是更早扫描的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs Full Disk Access first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要先获得“完全磁盘访问”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs access first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要先获得访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs access to %@ first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要先获得对 %1$@ 的访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs access to protected folders to find caches, app leftovers and disk usage. Scanning waits until access is available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要访问受保护的文件夹，才能查找缓存、应用残留和磁盘占用。在获得权限之前，扫描会等待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs access to your home folder before it can scan. What's shown is from earlier scans." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要访问你的个人文件夹才能扫描。当前显示的是更早扫描的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs administrator approval to restore the app from your Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要管理员批准才能从废纸篓恢复该应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs administrator approval to stop %@'s bundled background agents and move the app to your Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要管理员批准才能停止 %1$@ 内置的后台代理并把该应用移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to delete system caches and logs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要管理员权限才能删除系统缓存和日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to delete what the app left outside your Library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要管理员权限才能删除该应用留在你的“资源库”之外的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to run system maintenance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 需要管理员权限才能运行系统维护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole opens in %@ the next time it starts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 下次启动时将显示为 %1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole stopped waiting for the administrator task, which may still be running. What it changed isn't known yet, so no other system task runs until its completion can be verified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 已停止等待该管理员任务，它可能仍在运行。它改动了什么尚不清楚，因此在确认其完成之前不会运行其他系统任务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole stops its scans, turns off Open at Login, disables its optional helper and moves this copy to the Trash, then quits. Settings and saved results stay unless you choose them. Data another installed copy uses stays. Use Put Back in Finder's Trash to restore anything moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole 会停止扫描、关闭“登录时打开”、停用可选的辅助程序，并把这份副本移到废纸篓，然后退出。设置和已保存的结果除非你选择，否则会保留。其他已安装副本正在使用的数据会保留。要用访达废纸篓中的“放回原处”恢复被移动的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MyMole, %@ free" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MyMole，%1$@ 可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
