      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已跳过（%1$lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smaller Files" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较小的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smaller files, hidden files, apps and libraries (Photos, Music), Git repositories and dependency folders are left out, and so are cloud files that aren't downloaded. A folder inside another is searched once." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较小的文件、隐藏文件、应用与资源库（照片、音乐）、Git 仓库和依赖文件夹都会被排除，未下载的云端文件同样不包含。嵌套在其他文件夹中的文件夹只搜索一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smallest First" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最小优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
