    "Swap allocated" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已分配的交换空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch on the tasks you want. Check Tasks previews their effects; Optimize Now runs them after confirmation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开你需要的任务。“检查任务”可预览它们的效果；“立即优化”会在确认后运行它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Clean" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Clean Keep List" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统清理保留清单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Clean's keep list couldn't be read, so nothing system-wide was removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取“系统清理”的保留清单，因此没有移除任何系统级内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Clean, Optimize's administrator tasks and protected app moves need administrator rights. The optional helper lets macOS approve this once. Without it, macOS asks when each task runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统清理、“优化”的管理员任务以及受保护应用的移动都需要管理员权限。可选的辅助程序可让 macOS 一次性批准。不启用它时，macOS 会在每次任务运行时询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Tasks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统任务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System caches and logs are already tidy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统缓存和日志已经很整洁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System caches belong to root, which App Store apps may not ask for. The direct edition of MyMole cleans them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统缓存属于 root，应用商店版不能请求这类权限。MyMole 的直装版可以清理它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System cleanup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System index" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统索引"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System overview" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统概览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System tasks aren't part of this edition of MyMole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统任务不包含在此版本中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System tasks aren't part of this edition." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统任务不包含在此版本中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-wide caches and old logs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统级缓存和旧日志"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-wide caches need administrator rights; System Clean handles them" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统级缓存需要管理员权限；“系统清理”会处理它们"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-wide deletion cannot be combined with unverified manual matches." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统级删除无法与未核实的手动匹配同时进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-wide leftovers can't be removed in this edition. Untick them to go on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本无法移除系统级残留项。请取消勾选后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-wide settings or data are chosen. They're deleted for good, not moved to the Trash." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已选择系统级的设置或数据。它们会被彻底删除，而不是移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Table lines" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表格线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tagged %@; other copies are tagged differently. Choose which one stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已标记 %1$@；其他副本的标记不同。请选择保留哪一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags differ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标记不同"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tags only the chosen copies have go with them: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅所选副本才有的标记会随它们一起移动：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take Back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take MyMole out of the menu bar; closing its window quits it" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 MyMole 从菜单栏移除；关闭其窗口即退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text, menus and dialogs are drawn in this language. macOS settles it when MyMole starts, so a change takes effect the next time it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字、菜单和对话框都使用该语言显示。macOS 会在 MyMole 启动时确定语言，因此更改会在下次启动后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That app changed or already quit. Refresh the reading before trying again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该应用已更改或已退出。请刷新读取结果后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That was %@, not %@. Choose %@ itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That was %1$@, not %2$@. Choose %3$@ itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那是 %1$@，不是 %2$@。请选择 %3$@ 本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %lld chosen leftover%@ (%@) go to the Trash. The app already there stays untouched. Ownership and keep rules are checked again. You can undo right after." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The %1$lld chosen leftover%2$@ (%3$@) go to the Trash. The app already there stays untouched. Ownership and keep rules are checked again. You can undo right after."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The App Store edition works only in the folders you choose here. Full Disk Access in System Settings also lets it into the folders macOS protects inside them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用商店版只能在你于此选择的文件夹中工作。在“系统设置”中授予“完全磁盘访问”，还能让它进入这些文件夹内受 macOS 保护的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Finder move was cancelled. No app data was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "访达的移动操作已取消。没有移动任何应用数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Photos library is left alone: remove pictures there in Photos. Nothing leaves the Mac; pictures are compared by a small fingerprint made here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“照片”图库不会被改动：请在那里的“照片”中删除照片。任何内容都不会离开这台 Mac；照片通过在本机生成的少量指纹进行比对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Trash is already empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "废纸篓已经是空的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The administrator move could not be verified. No app data was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法核实管理员移动操作。没有移动任何应用数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app and %lld leftover%@ are moved to the Trash. You can undo right after." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The app and %1$lld leftover%2$@ are moved to the Trash. You can undo right after."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app changed after the review. Nothing was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用在检查之后发生了变化。没有移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app changed before Finder could move it. Refresh the review. No app data was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用在访达执行移动前发生了变化。请刷新检查。没有移动任何应用数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app changed before it could be unlocked. Refresh the review." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用在解锁前发生了变化。请刷新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app changed, already quit, or couldn't accept the request. No other process was asked to quit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用已更改、已退出，或无法接受该请求。没有要求其他进程退出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app could not be verified at its original location. Undo can retry from its last verified location. Check in Finder before trying again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法在原位置核实该应用。撤销可以从上次核实的位置重试。重试前请在访达中确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app in the Trash changed or was restored. Choose it again before cleaning its leftovers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "废纸篓中的应用发生了变化或被恢复。清理其残留项前请重新选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is asked to quit normally, so it can save its work or ask you first. A changed or restarted process is left alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会请求应用正常退出，以便它保存工作或先询问你。发生变化或已重启的进程会被跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is missing, unreadable or has been replaced. Close this review and reload the app list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用已缺失、无法读取，或已被替换。请关闭此检查并重新载入应用列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is open. Quit it first for a clean result." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用正在运行。请先退出以获得干净的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app may rebuild or download this data again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用可能会重新生成或再次下载这些数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app move could not be verified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法核实应用移动操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app or its original folder changed, or the original location is occupied. Nothing there will be replaced. Check in Finder before trying Undo again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用或其原文件夹已更改，或原位置已被占用。那里的内容不会被替换。再次尝试撤销前请在访达中确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app restore could not be verified." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法核实应用恢复操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app's move to the Trash could not be verified. No app data was moved. Check the app in Finder before trying again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法核实应用移到废纸篓的操作。没有移动任何应用数据。重试前请在访达中确认该应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The complete folder contents couldn't be selected. Nothing was added. Check access or choose smaller groups." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法选定完整的文件夹内容。没有添加任何内容。请检查访问权限，或选择更小的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copies of %lld file%@ have different tags, so they're left for you to choose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The copies of %1$lld file%2$@ have different tags, so they're left for you to choose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy you keep is on %@, which can be disconnected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你保留的副本位于 %1$@ 上，该位置可能会断开连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image file couldn't be found." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找不到该磁盘映像文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk image is ejected, then moved to the Trash. You can undo right after." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会先推出磁盘映像，再移到废纸篓。你可以随后立即撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk, memory and what the scans found at a glance. MyMole keeps running there when its window is closed; Quit ends it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一眼看到磁盘、内存和扫描发现。关闭窗口后 MyMole 仍会在菜单栏运行；选择“退出”才会结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder couldn't be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取该文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folders searched for duplicates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索重复项所用的文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folders searched for installers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索安装包所用的文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper handles approved app moves and system tasks without asking for an administrator password for every action. macOS asks you to approve it once. You still choose and confirm what MyMole removes. You can disable it in Settings → System Tasks.\n\nWithout the helper, this action continues with macOS's administrator prompt." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辅助程序会在不逐次询问管理员密码的情况下处理已批准的应用移动和系统任务。macOS 只会要求你批准一次。你要移除什么，仍然由你选择和确认。可以在“设置”→“系统任务”中停用它。\n\n不使用辅助程序时，此操作会改用 macOS 的管理员提示继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper isn't available in this copy of MyMole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 MyMole 副本中没有可用的辅助程序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed apps couldn't be read, so no leftovers were offered. Reload Apps and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取已安装的应用，因此没有提供残留项。请重新载入应用后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The installed apps couldn't be read, so nothing was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取已安装的应用，因此没有移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keep list couldn't be read" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取保留清单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keep list couldn't be read, so the change isn't saved yet: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取保留清单，因此更改尚未保存：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keep list couldn't be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取保留清单。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keep lists couldn't be read, so nothing is moved: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取保留清单，因此没有移动任何内容：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last few minutes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近几分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last scans found: %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近几次扫描发现：%1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move was stopped or the app started. Nothing was moved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移动已停止，或应用已启动。没有移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The optional helper handles administrator tasks after macOS approval. You still review and confirm removals. App Management and Full Disk Access are separate macOS permissions; enabling the helper doesn't grant them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可选的辅助程序会在 macOS 批准后处理管理员任务。移除操作仍由你检查并确认。“应用管理”和“完全磁盘访问”是 macOS 的另一项独立权限；启用辅助程序并不会授予它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The privileged tool didn't finish (code %d)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "特权工具未完成（代码 %1$d）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The privileged tool gave an unexpected answer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "特权工具返回了意外的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program it starts isn't there any more." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它启动的程序已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The project folder hasn't been measured yet. Rescan to see what's inside it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "尚未测量该项目文件夹。重新扫描即可查看其中的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scan couldn't be saved: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保存扫描：%1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search reached its size or depth limit. Choose a smaller folder to inspect the remaining apps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索达到了大小或深度上限。请选择更小的文件夹以检查其余应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search reached its time or entry limit. Results are incomplete; only completely measured candidates are offered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索达到了时间或条目上限。结果不完整；只提供已完整测量的候选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The search was limited or partly unreadable for %@. Only completely measured candidates are offered; additional app data may remain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对 %1$@ 的搜索受限或部分无法读取。只提供已完整测量的候选项；可能仍有其他应用数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The smallest change listed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列出的最小变更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The startup disk" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动磁盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tool that made it noted this project's path with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生成它的工具同时记录了该项目的路径。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their contents aren't counted above. Most are protected by macOS; Full Disk Access lets MyMole see inside the ones that belong to you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们的内容未计入上方统计。多数受 macOS 保护；授予“完全磁盘访问”后，MyMole 才能看清属于你的那些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These components may serve other Google products or installations. They aren't attributed exclusively to this app and aren't separate removal choices here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些组件可能还供其他 Google 产品或安装使用。它们并非专属此应用，因此在这里不作为单独的移除选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items and everything inside them stay, even when a parent is chosen for cleanup. Path rules also protect moves to the Trash in other views." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使父项被选作清理，这些项目及其中的全部内容也会保留。路径规则在其他视图中同样会阻止移到废纸篓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These names are excluded inside Projects, including their contents. To protect a folder from Trash moves in other views too, whitelist its specific path." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些名称会在“项目”中被排除，其内容也一并排除。若要在其他视图中也阻止该文件夹被移到废纸篓，请把它的具体路径加入保留列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They appear here as the scan finds them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描发现时会逐个出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They couldn't be read through, or changed while they were read, so whether they have copies isn't known. Search again to try them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们无法完整读取，或在读取过程中发生了变化，因此无法确定是否有副本。请重新搜索以再次尝试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Folder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This adds a cleanup suggestion on future scans. Nothing is removed now. Source control, protected locations and whitelist rules still take priority." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会在以后的扫描中添加清理建议。现在不会移除任何内容。版本控制、受保护位置和保留规则仍然优先。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app and the %lld chosen data item%@ go to the Trash. Open at Login is turned off. MyMole then quits. You can restore them with Put Back in Finder's Trash; in-app Undo isn't available after quitting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This app and the %1$lld chosen data item%2$@ go to the Trash. Open at Login is turned off. MyMole then quits. You can restore them with Put Back in Finder's Trash; in-app Undo isn't available after quitting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app changed or couldn't be fully read. Scan again before reviewing its removal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此应用已更改或无法完整读取。检查其移除前请重新扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is already in the Trash. Only the chosen leftovers move; shared identities still used by installed apps stay. Settings and personal data stay unless you choose them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此应用已在废纸篓中。只会移动选中的残留项；仍被已安装应用使用的共享身份标识会保留。设置和个人数据除非你选择，否则会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此副本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy has no tags; other copies do. Choose which one stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此副本没有标记；其他副本有。请选择保留哪一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy is included when you uninstall MyMole." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "卸载 MyMole 时会包含此副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy is kept and cannot be uninstalled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此副本已保留，无法卸载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy is kept, so it stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此副本已保留，因此会留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of MyMole changed after the review. Nothing was moved. Open the review again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 MyMole 副本在检查后发生了变化。没有移动任何内容。请重新打开检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of MyMole changed on disk. Open the installed app and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 MyMole 副本在磁盘上发生了变化。请打开已安装的应用后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of MyMole couldn't be verified. Nothing was moved. Open the installed app and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法核实这份 MyMole 副本。没有移动任何内容。请打开已安装的应用后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of MyMole is kept. Remove it from your Keep list before uninstalling it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这份 MyMole 副本已保留。卸载前请先把它从保留清单中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder couldn't be fully read. Its previous scan stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法完整读取此文件夹。仍保留它上次的扫描结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder has no files or folders in the current map." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在当前的磁盘图中，此文件夹没有文件或子文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder has no mapped contents." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件夹没有已绘制的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder isn't on this Mac, or can't be read: a saved scan only knows how many small files it had." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此文件夹不在这台 Mac 上，或无法读取：保存的扫描只记录它曾有多少个小文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the top of the map." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里是磁盘图的最顶层。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This list couldn't be read (%@). Nothing is removed against it until it can be." : {
