          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning a question off applies only to that action. Your choices, Keep rules and all file checks still apply. Manually chosen unverified matches, permanent deletion, emptying the Trash, system maintenance, startup changes, similar-photo removal and uninstalling MyMole always ask." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭某个询问只对那次操作生效。你的选择、保留规则和所有文件检查仍然有效。手动选择的未核实匹配项、彻底删除、清空废纸篓、系统维护、启动项更改、相似照片移除和卸载 MyMole 始终会询问。"
