    "Undo puts back the last %lld moves of each pane until you quit; after that, Finder's Put Back still works for what is in the Trash. Items moved to the Trash take space until it's emptied. History keeps only counts and sizes, never file names." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你退出前，撤销可以放回各面板最近 %1$lld 次移动的内容；退出后，对废纸篓中的内容仍可使用访达的“放回原处”。移到废纸篓的项目在清空之前仍占空间。历史只保留数量和大小，从不记录文件名。"
