    "Website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Changes compares against. Fewer keep less on disk; older scans go as new ones are saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“变更”比较所依据的数据。保留越少占用的磁盘越少；保存新扫描时会清除更早的扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Homebrew and installer packages put on the Mac, to look at" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Homebrew 和安装包放到 Mac 上的内容，供查看"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What starts by itself, and the plug-ins apps added" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会自动启动的内容，以及应用添加的插件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's in %@ isn't listed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 中的内容不会列出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's in %@ isn't listed. The result isn't saved as complete; give MyMole Full Disk Access or scan again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 中的内容不会列出。该结果不会保存为完整结果；请授予 MyMole“完全磁盘访问”或重新扫描。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's on screen stays until you quit. After the next launch each pane scans afresh. Keep lists, project rules and History aren't touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕上的内容会保留到你退出为止。下次启动后，每个面板会重新扫描。保留清单、项目规则和历史不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's on the disk but isn't in this map" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘上有但不在磁盘图中的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wheel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轮盘图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a scan finds a lot to clean" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描发现大量可清理项时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app in the Trash left things behind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "废纸篓中的应用留下遗留时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When an app keeps the processor busy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用持续占用处理器时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When macOS warns that memory is short, scans started ahead of time stop and icon and chart caches empty; when it's critical, a disk map that isn't on screen goes too. Nothing you're looking at, have chosen or can undo is touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 macOS 提示内存不足时，提前启动的扫描会停止，图标和图表缓存会清空；内存严重不足时，不在屏幕上的磁盘图也会释放。你正在查看、已选择或可撤销的内容不会被触碰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the disk is nearly full" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "磁盘将满时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your space went" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空间都用在了哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While MyMole runs, also in the menu bar, when the Mac has time to spare. Scans only read; nothing is removed until you choose it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 MyMole 运行期间使用；Mac 空闲时也会在菜单栏工作。扫描只读取；在你选择之前不会移除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist These %lld Items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留这 %1$lld 项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist everything named “%@”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留所有名为“%1$@”的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist excludes a folder and its contents, including when a parent is cleaned. Blacklist adds a cleanup suggestion; it doesn't delete or select anything. Pins keep apps and folders easy to reach and don't change protection. Right-click a folder to change these choices." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留会将文件夹及其内容排除，即使父项被清理也一样。排除只会添加清理建议，不会删除或选择任何内容。固定只是让应用和文件夹更易访问，不改变保护状态。右键点击文件夹即可更改这些设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist excludes items and their contents from cleanup. Blacklist adds cleanup suggestions. Pinning is quick access only. Right-click a folder to change its rule; saved rules apply on every scan." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留会把项目及其内容排除在清理之外。排除会添加清理建议。固定仅用于快速访问。右键点击文件夹即可更改其规则；已保存的规则在每次扫描时都会生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist project folders" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留项目文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist — Never Clean This" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留 —— 永不清理此项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist — exclude from cleanup" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留 —— 排除在清理之外"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whitelist “%@” in Every Project" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在每个项目中保留“%1$@”"
