    "Write" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written in the last few minutes, probably by something running in the background. Left unticked; tick it yourself if it can go." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近几分钟内有写入，可能是后台运行的某个东西写的。已保持未勾选；如果可以移除，请自行勾选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "昨天 %1$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also use Edit Layout on the page. Row heights stay aligned, and hidden cards remain available from the hidden-cards menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你也可以在页面上使用“编辑布局”。行高会保持对齐，隐藏的卡片仍可从隐藏卡片菜单中取回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're at the top" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已在最上方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your caches and logs are already tidy." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的缓存和日志已经很整洁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your cards are hidden. Show them again without changing their saved sizes or order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的卡片已隐藏。再次显示时不会改变已保存的大小和顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your change couldn't be saved (%@). Nothing is removed until it's saved or given up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法保存你的更改（%1$@）。在保存或放弃之前，不会移除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your change to the keep list couldn't be saved (%@). Nothing is moved until it is saved or given up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你对保留清单的更改无法保存（%1$@）。在保存或放弃之前，不会移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your change to the keep list couldn't be saved (%@). Nothing is removed until it is saved or given up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你对保留清单的更改无法保存（%1$@）。在保存或放弃之前，不会移除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your data is chosen: documents and databases the app made go with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已选择你的数据：应用创建的文件和数据库会随之一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your disk is nearly full" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的磁盘快满了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your home folder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的个人文件夹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your home folder Applications The startup disk Give Access Take Back permissions bookmarks sandbox" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的个人文件夹 应用程序 启动磁盘 授予访问权限 收回 权限 书签 沙盒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your keep list couldn't be read (%@). Nothing is moved until it can be." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取你的保留清单（%1$@）。在能读取之前，不会移动任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your keep list couldn't be read (%@). Nothing is removed until it can be." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取你的保留清单（%1$@）。在能读取之前，不会移除任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your keep lists couldn't be read, so nothing is moved until they can be. Look at Deep Clean's list in Settings and your rules in Projects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取你的保留清单，因此在能读取之前不会移动任何内容。请查看“设置”中“深度清理”的清单，以及“项目”中的规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your keep lists couldn't be read, so nothing is uninstalled until they can be. Look at the lists in Settings and your rules in Projects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
