    "macOS apps stay installed; only resetting their caches and settings is offered." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 自带应用会保持安装状态；只提供重置其缓存和设置的选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS can require App Management permission to remove other apps; Full Disk Access is a separate permission. Allow the copy of MyMole you're using in Privacy & Security → App Management. File permissions or administrator approval can also affect a move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除其他应用时，macOS 可能要求“应用管理”权限；“完全磁盘访问”是另一项独立权限。请在“隐私与安全性”→“应用管理”中允许你正在使用的这份 MyMole 副本。文件权限或管理员批准也可能影响移动操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS denied the move of a system-owned app. Finder may need administrator approval. Check App Management and Finder Automation, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 拒绝了移动系统所有的应用。访达可能需要管理员批准。请检查“应用管理”和“访达自动化”，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS denied the move. File access or permissions may still block it. You can move the app in Finder; its data stays in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 拒绝了此次移动。文件访问权限或权限设置仍可能阻止它。你可以在访达中移动该应用；它的数据会留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS denied these moves. File access or permissions may still block them. You can use Finder; the apps' data stays in place." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 拒绝了这些移动。文件访问权限或权限设置仍可能阻止它们。你可以使用访达；这些应用的数据会留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
